                    ],
                    Name: "Wei — the circle half walked",
                    Label: "in_progress__or3"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Where are the four wardens",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add pilgrimage_started"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "stations"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "stations_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "I will walk them",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add pilgrimage_started"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Up here we practice the old botany. Blossom holds the badge, but the badge grew out of the old way — four stone wardens the first gardeners carved across the city, long before there was a building to keep a badge in."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "If you mean to challenge her, do it the old way. Walk to the four wardens — the old bough, the gate garden, the stone knight, the quiet garden. Wake each, best it, and press the seal at its pedestal. Four seals, and this hill will bless your challenge."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Wei — the old botany",
                    Label: "default"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Back",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add pilgrimage_started"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "To the wardens",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add pilgrimage_started"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Four stone wardens stand across the city. Up in the oldest tree, out on the great branch, the warden of the old bough keeps its arms folded and will not hurry. In the little garden at the gym gate, a second weighs everyone who passes its threshold."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "In the square stands the stone knight — straight-backed and in armour, where the others are gardeners. And over the smallest plot, the warden of the quiet garden keeps watch on the honest crop. Wake each, best it, and press its seal — in any order they please, then climb back up to me."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Wei — naming the wardens",
                    Label: "stations"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Thank you, Master Wei",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "This stone came out of the roots of the old bough forty years ago and has been waiting on a worthy pocket ever since. Some of what you carry will know what to do with it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Now go and see Blossom. Tell her the hill sent you — she will know what that costs me to say."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Wei — the handoff",
                    Label: "blessed"
                }
            ]
        },
